{"id":4118309022,"user":"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]","body":"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Force an interrupt status after prompt Ctrl+C**

