{"id":4118045582,"user":"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]","body":"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Keep a newer invoking canary instead of relaunching an older one**

